noVNC (D-007)
-------------
The live Screen feature vendors noVNC 1.7.0 (tag v1.7.0, commit
63107bd06d9e1f6136ff21aeda8cd62cbf0d433e, npm @novnc/novnc 1.7.0) unmodified,
as a separate component in dashboard/vendor/novnc/.

noVNC's core is licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (MPL-2.0),
with MIT-licensed vendor/pako/ and BSD-style notices in core/crypto/des.js.
Only core/ and vendor/pako/ are used; noVNC's app/ assets are excluded.
LuveBot's own integration code remains outside the vendored folder.

